  "body": "Here's a test for the \"change\" event on `<textarea>` elements:\r\nhttps://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=10441\r\n\r\nThe event fires when moving focus in Chrome, Firefox and Safari.\r\n\r\nThe spec for this appears to be https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#focus-update-steps.\r\n\r\nBut this starts with \"If _entry_ is an `input` element\", which a `<textarea>` element is not.\r\n\r\nNo other occurrence of \"named change\" seems to apply to `<textarea>` elements either.\r\n\r\nThe problem might also apply to \"input\" events, I haven't tested that.",
